From b092d2f7614309502e8d8b3d29b4b8b9b915b68c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Davide-F5-Marincione <marincione@di.uniroma1.it>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 00:55:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] =?UTF-8?q?RR:=20diagnose=20the=20rotation-keyswitch?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20failure=20=E2=80=94=20the=20KEY=20is=20fine,=20the=20CPU=20M?=
